<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yude</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Yude</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yude</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yude</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Yude, wu baatsindihi huli Bamukristo boosi. Mambu ma nde maafwanina na ma muhanda wa myole wa Peetelo. Buuna, musonihi a muhanda mo wunuuwu, li mu ulwanisa baatu ba bubaalongese mapfuta na ubaadyata butsa-butsa. Utwala ufwanisa bitsudu bya 6-13 bi muhanda mo wunuuwu, na muhanda a myole wa Peetelo buli la byole.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi muhanda mo wunuuwu, li mu usalila ka makuma ma Nzuhisini Lilikulu. Na mu mo, nde li mu ubaha ndongisili yi ulongese Bamukristo ba taangu a nde. Nde li mu usalila ka, makuma ma Bayudaayo ma mavele hutso Mabuuku ma Ngidi (bit 9,14,15).</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi li mu usaangula na mifudi, buni Nzambi ubaasyembe baatu ba bubaabuma mambu ma nde ma litondo (bitini 3-13). Ka nde li mu uleele ka: baafwana ukwila bo lingebe na ukumbasa bo mu ubata kesi a Nzambi (bitini 22-23).</para>
  <para style="ip">Eye, tso muhanda a Yude na makuma ma nde ali mu usalila mali ma mifudi, ni mu uhaha bubi na tsingiili. Mifudi mo miina a mu tooni ubungasana bo ve, ka ni mu ufuuhasa bo.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Me Yude, muviha a Yisu Kristo na mwaana a ngu a Yaki. Me ndi mu utsonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu, huli boosi ba Taata Nzambi hateele, ba nde hatondo na ba nde ubaakeelese mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Nyaha kwili lingebe, hyenze na litondo bi byafulala, bava huli benu.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Milongiisi mi mibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Bambaahi ba me baa litondo, me amba na lehemene li lafulala mu usonehele benu muhanda, mu tooni itwadi hi liyobolo la bisu a benu. Me moni ti, me apfwana usonehele benu nde, mu uhwadisa benu mu ulwana mu tooni a hiitu hi Nzambi haviidi va limosi, huli bisu a benu baatu bangidi. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Me ndi mu utsonehele benu, mu tooni ati, ŋa hati la benu baatu bababi bakima, baamiiyakotelele benu mu tswehi. Bo bali baatu ba baavelekiinza Nzambi a bisu, mu usobo bubwe bwa nde mu mbili a bo yi bumbembo. Na bo bali mu utunala ka Yisu Kristo, Mulongisi na Pfumu a bisu mumosi wu. Ka umata beleve, Libuuku la Ngidi laamiiyabisa tsyembili yi bo buyaka. <verse eid="JUD 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Eye, benu laamiikwayaba maana moosi nzyeni. Ka me ndi mu unzibwala benu moonyi, buni Pfumu hayobili bisu Isereli hu tsi a Ngipiti. Na buni nde hadubi banga mutima ngototo. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Yibwalaani moonyi mu bapofi ba baavelikeelese butsitu bwa biita la bo na ba baatimbi nzo a bo. Nzambi amiihada bo mu mapanga ma bitali, hutso a pipidi yinene, tswamina ilumbu hya tsundusu mu uto. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Yibwalaani ka moonyi mu bisu Sodoomo na Ngomooro, na baa misyenge mikima mya bebele. Ba baakatsahala mu misyenge mo miina, baaba na mbiili yi butsutsungu we yi bapofi mo baana. Baatu mo baana baakasa bumbembo, na mayamba. Bo bali na tsyembili ya mbaahu yi bilima na bilima. Yina yili kebisili huli baatu boosi. <verse eid="JUD 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Bumosi ka mu baatu ba baakotilili benu mu tswehi, bubaalooto ma mu baabehe tsumili mu manyutu ma bo. Bo bali mu urokolo lituma la Nzambi, na bo bubaatuha bapofi ba muyusu a hu yulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Tso mukuutu bapofi Mikayeli, a hasa buuna ve. Mu taangu yi nde hakasa litsotso na Saatana mu tooni a mvumbi a Moose, Mikayeli a hakesili nde tsyembili bituhi ve. Ka ndulu nde aleeli bunubu: «Nyaha Pfumu asyembe we!»<verse eid="JUD 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ka baatu mobaniba bali mu urokolo bi bo baaveletsikaha. Na bi bo baayaba, bo baayaba byo we bibulu bya bwadi bi byavele buyedi. Mbiili mo yiina yili mu ubungasana bo. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Lingebe huli bo! Mu tooni ati, bo baasumihi we musumihi Kayini. Bo baadungi mu tooni a lingi la mbongo, we bu mumbihuli Balaami hasiidi. Bo baakwidi mu tooni ati, bo baatumbihi we bu Kore hasiidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kayini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">utala<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Mba 4.3-8</ref></char>. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Balaami </char><char style="ft" closed="false">utala <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 31:16">Mat 31.16</ref></char>. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kore</char><char style="ft" closed="false">utala <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Mat 16.1-35</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Baatu mo baana, bubaayungasa na bubaabiyasa mikungi mya benu mi udya, mi itwadi hya baana bangu. Bo bubaadya itwadi na benu hwavele buyumu, na bo ubaatsima ndulu bo mwakulu. Bo bali we mayidu ma maleme, ma mavelenohese mvula, ma bifula bibaabita. Bo bali we miti mi myavelebuta mbutu, tso ŋa mwanga. Na bu bamitupala myo, myo mibaakwa kwa yoole. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bo baafwanina na mapo ma mifudi ma mubu. Bo bali mu utswamisa ŋa busu bwa bo, mavaanga ma bo ma tsonyi. Mavaanga mo maana mali we mafudi ma mbindu yi mapo mu baatsindala. Bo bali we bamvwelele baa mikila. Na Nzambi amiiswehele bo mbuha a nzyeni hutso butsuhu bu bwafulala pipidi. <verse eid="JUD 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enooke, kaaha a bisu wu mutsambu mu imbisa hya Adami, abihuli mu tooni a baatu mo bababi baana. Nde abihuli: «Yuhaani: Pfumu sa aya na biveeve na biveeve bi bapofi ba nde bangidi, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />mu utsundasa baatu boosi. Pfumu sa asyembe banga masumu boosi mu tooni mavaanga ma mabi. Pfumu sa asyembe bo, mu tooni bituhi bi baatu mobaniba, ba baavele na buyumu baapalisi mu nde.» <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Baatu mo baana a bubaaba na kinya ve, bo bali mu uŋono taangu yoosi mu idiingu hya bo. Bo bali mu udukala manzala ma linyungi la bo. Minywa mya bo mili mu upalisa mambu ma nyehe, ma usohese baatu mu ubaha kaluha.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukami mu ukangama mu Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ka huli benu bambaahi ba me, yibwalaani moonyi mu mambu ma biluumbi bya Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, byayabisi benu hutsomi. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Byo baayabisi benu: «Hu tsukusu a taangu, sa huba na bakwedi. Bo bukaakwede Nzambi na baatu ba nde. Na baa bukaadyata we bu huli matsimi ma mabi, ma mu utahusa bo na Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2Pe 3.3</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ni bo baana, bali mu ubehe buraandu! Bo bubaaduukala matsimi ma nyutu a bo, na Livupu la Nzambi a lili mu bo ve.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ka benu, bambaahi ba me ba mutima, hwadaani mu ukula mu imiinu hya ngidi hya benu. Sambilaani mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Kwilalaani ka hutso litondo la Nzambi, mu ukeele Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo. Mu bubwe bwa nde, benu luubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Baani na kwili lingebe mu baatu ba bakini na matsika. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Huli na bakima baa benu luutwala uyobolo, mu upalisa bo hutso a mbaahu. Huli bakima ka, kwilaani bo lingebe, kwili lingebe yi buyedi bwosi. Ka mu ukwila bo lingebe, baakelaani ukubaana bikutu bya bo, bi bili na mapiti ma mavaanga ma bo ma musunya.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muula a tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Nzambi li na matwala ma ukeelese benu, mana benu livelebwa mu masumu. Na nde ni wu usa ti, benu limonehele baatu ba baavele ipiha, na ba baaluula mu kinya ŋa busu bu muyusu a nde. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Nde li Nzambi mosi ndulu, ni nde ayobili bisu mu likumbasa la Yisu Kristo, Pfumu a bisu. Nyaha muyusu, bunene, matwala na lituma, biba na nde umata pangili a tsi, bunubu na mu bilima na bilima! Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>